    <h1 class="section-heading">Departments as Performance Systems</h1>
    <div class="content-body">
        <p>The underpinning of the strategic action planning methodology is the <span data-field="total_performance_system">{{ total_performance_system }}</span> model developed by Dr. Dale M. Brethower, professors emeritus of the WMU Department of Psychology.</p>
        <p>By taking a systems view of their organizations, participants created holistic mission, vision, and goals and created a conceptual framework for performance measurement.</p>
        <div style="text-align: center; margin: 50px 0;">
            <!-- Diagram Placeholder -->
            <div style="border: 1px solid #000; padding: 20px; display: inline-block;">
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-around;">
                    <div style="text-align: center;">
                        <div style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 5px;">Resources</div>
                        <div style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 5px;">Internal Processes</div>
                        <div style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 5px;">Services & Products</div>
                        <div style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 5px;">Clients, Customers, Stakeholders</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-around; margin-top: 20px;">
                    <div style="text-align: center;">
                        <div style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 5px;">Process Feedback</div>
                    </div>
                    <div style="text-align: center;">
                        <div style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 5px;">Outcome Feedback</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
            <ol>
                <li>
                    <span data-field="list_item_1_title">{{ list_item_1_title }}</span>
                    <p>The major purpose - or the reason for the existence - of the system. The vision provides strategic direction.</p>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <span data-field="list_item_2_title">{{ list_item_2_title }}</span>
                    <p>Information, technology, people, money, or material that is a resource for – or initiates – internal work processes.</p>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <span data-field="list_item_3_title">{{ list_item_3_title }}</span>
                    <p>Processes that use resources to generate outputs valued by customers and stakeholders.</p>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <span data-field="list_item_4_title">{{ list_item_4_title }}</span>
                    <p>Information about operational performance (efficiency and quality) of individuals, work groups, or processes.</p>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <span data-field="list_item_5_title">{{ list_item_5_title }}</span>
                    <p>Outputs produced by the internal processes. Can be tangible products or intangible services.</p>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <span data-field="list_item_6_title">{{ list_item_6_title }}</span>
                    <p>Anybody receiving or benefiting from a service or product - Customers, stakeholders, the community.</p>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <span data-field="list_item_7_title">{{ list_item_7_title }}</span>
                    <p>External information about service outcomes and quality from customers and other external sources.</p>
                </li>
            </ol>
        </div>
    </div>
